    "title": "Emergency Closure Order Issued for Qury Fire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karli Ferry ,\n1 days ago Closure Implemented to Protect Firefighter and Public Safety. (Custer, SD, March 17, 2026)— The Black Hills National Forest has issued an emergency closure order for the Qury Fire, which was reported March 12, 2026, two miles southeast of Custer, SD. The closure order, which is for public and firefighter safety, is in effect March 17, 2026 to April 16, 2026, unless modified or rescinded sooner. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
